Match traits and manager boosts.

• Every player now has a second, match trait slot — twelve traits that pay in a derby, a cup tie, a relegation fight or the last fifteen minutes.
• Six boosts to spend in a live match: Crowd Roar, Park the Bus and Sharp Shooting from the pitch; VAR Review, the Physio Sponge and a Quiet Word from the bench.
• Full-time stats redrawn, traits in the game's own artwork, and five gems in the Starter Pack.
